        "id": "YorickPassive",
        "name": "Shepherd of Souls",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "<font color='#FF9900'>The Cursed Horde:</font> Yorick can summon Mist Walkers to swarm and attack nearby enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Yorick raises a grave for every 2 enemies that die near him. Champions and large monsters always leave a grave.<br /><br />These graves can be used to <span>Awaken</span> <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mist Walkers</span> with <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(15% bonus Health) Health</span> and <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(20% bonus Attack Damage) Attack Damage</span>, up to 4 in an area.",
