        "id": "YorickQ",
        "name": "Last Rites",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Yorick deals bonus damage on his next attack and heals himself. If the target is a champion or large monster or if the target dies, a grave will be dug.",
        "bodyHtml": "Yorick's next Attack deals an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30/50/70/90/110 + (50% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(10 ~ 58) plus 6/7/8/9/10% of his missing Health</span>, reduced by 50% against non-Champions. If this Attack hits a Champion or large Monster or kills the target, it leaves a grave.<br /><br />When there are 3 or more graves nearby and this Ability has already been used, Yorick can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> to raise <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mist Walkers</span> from all nearby graves.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability triggers spell effects upon dealing damage.</span>",
